WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 e7238c6ce2c79f908f0260c1c2c286e0

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:02.980
Karibu tena. Sawa, natumaini sasa unajiamini

00:00:03.040 --> 00:00:05.620
katika kutumia vitendakazi na katika

00:00:05.660 --> 00:00:09.380
kuweka maingizo kwenye vitendakazi. Hadi sasa,

00:00:09.560 --> 00:00:11.340
umekuwa ukitumia namba tu,

00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:12.820
lakini mara nyingi, unataka

00:00:12.900 --> 00:00:15.180
pia kuweza kuweka maandishi kwenye

00:00:15.220 --> 00:00:18.340
vitendakazi. Kama ulivyoona, unapotaka

00:00:18.520 --> 00:00:20.800
kutumia namba, unaweza kuandika

00:00:20.810 --> 00:00:22.980
namba hiyo moja kwa moja, na Jiki anajua

00:00:23.040 --> 00:00:25.320
unachomaanisha. Lakini vipi ikiwa unataka

00:00:25.420 --> 00:00:27.390
kutumia herufi, neno, au

00:00:27.420 --> 00:00:30.620
sentensi? Kwa mfano, kitendakazi cha rectangle (mstatili) au

00:00:30.640 --> 00:00:32.619
kitendakazi cha circle (duara), vipi ikiwa ungekuwa na

00:00:32.720 --> 00:00:36.840
ingizo la ziada la kuainisha rangi? Tungeandikaje

00:00:36.880 --> 00:00:38.540
rangi hiyo ili kuiweka

00:00:38.600 --> 00:00:40.620
kwenye mashine? Tukiandika tu

00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:43.760
neno green (kijani) au blue (bluu), Jiki atadhani

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:46.449
tunazungumzia mashine iliyo rafuni, na

00:00:46.480 --> 00:00:48.940
atasema, "Hakuna mashine inayoitwa green.

00:00:49.540 --> 00:00:51.900
Sijui nifanye nini." Kwa hiyo

00:00:51.960 --> 00:00:54.280
tuna kanuni: kila tunapohitaji

00:00:54.320 --> 00:00:56.660
kutumia maandishi, tunayafunga

00:00:56.740 --> 00:00:59.760
kwa alama za nukuu, yaani alama mbili za nukuu.

00:01:01.000 --> 00:01:03.080
Na unapoweka kitu ndani ya alama za nukuu

00:01:03.140 --> 00:01:05.679
kama hivi, Jiki hutoa karatasi

00:01:05.720 --> 00:01:07.620
na kuandika chochote ulichoweka ndani ya

00:01:07.640 --> 00:01:10.820
alama hizo za nukuu kwenye karatasi hiyo, na

00:01:10.860 --> 00:01:15.290
tunaziita karatasi hizo strings (mfuatano wa herufi). Strings

00:01:15.320 --> 00:01:18.980
zinaweza kuwa herufi moja, maneno, sentensi, aya, hata

00:01:19.120 --> 00:01:22.800
vitabu. Kanuni ni hii: ikiwa ni maandishi,

00:01:22.840 --> 00:01:25.020
tunayaweka kwenye alama za nukuu, na hayo huwa

00:01:25.120 --> 00:01:28.160
string. Kwa hiyo, tukitaka kupata

00:01:28.200 --> 00:01:30.820
mstatili wa bluu, tunaandika namba ya

00:01:30.860 --> 00:01:32.810
nafasi yake ya kushoto, nafasi yake ya juu, upana wake, na

00:01:32.840 --> 00:01:35.830
urefu wake. Lakini kwa ingizo la tano,

00:01:35.860 --> 00:01:40.200
tutaandika "blue" ndani ya alama za nukuu. Jiki angeichukua

00:01:40.240 --> 00:01:42.040
mashine kutoka rafuni, akaweka sarafu

00:01:42.180 --> 00:01:45.000
kwenye matundu manne ya kwanza. Kisha

00:01:45.020 --> 00:01:47.380
ataandika blue kwenye karatasi,

00:01:47.400 --> 00:01:49.180
akaiweka karatasi hiyo kwenye tundu la tano,

00:01:49.460 --> 00:01:52.600
na kisha kuendesha mashine. Sasa, neno string ni

00:01:52.660 --> 00:01:55.120
mojawapo ya maneno ya kiufundi ambayo watu

00:01:55.160 --> 00:01:57.800
huyahofu kidogo mwanzoni, lakini kwa kweli

00:01:57.880 --> 00:01:59.940
linamaanisha maandishi tu. Utalizoea

00:02:00.020 --> 00:02:04.180
haraka sana. Hakuna jambo la kichawi kuhusu hilo.

00:02:04.220 --> 00:02:06.160
Katika mazoezi machache yajayo, utachora

00:02:06.200 --> 00:02:09.389
zaidi, na utaainisha rangi, na

00:02:09.420 --> 00:02:11.480
rangi unazotarajiwa kutumia

00:02:11.500 --> 00:02:13.660
zitaandikwa kwenye maagizo. Kwa hiyo soma

00:02:13.680 --> 00:02:17.020
maagizo kwa makini. Sawa, kabla hatujafika kwenye

00:02:17.040 --> 00:02:19.160
mazoezi, kuna jambo moja zaidi nataka

00:02:19.200 --> 00:02:23.400
kulizungumzia kwa haraka, nalo ni muhimu sana. Kozi hii

00:02:23.460 --> 00:02:26.260
ina malengo matatu tofauti. La kwanza ni kwamba

00:02:26.340 --> 00:02:29.300
ujifunze misingi ya kiufundi ya kupanga programu,

00:02:29.320 --> 00:02:31.860
ujue string au kitendakazi ni nini.

00:02:31.920 --> 00:02:33.920
La pili ni kwamba ujenge modeli ya kiakili

00:02:34.100 --> 00:02:35.960
ambayo unaweza kuipanua unapojifunza

00:02:36.100 --> 00:02:38.310
mawazo magumu zaidi baadaye. Hiyo ndiyo

00:02:38.360 --> 00:02:41.720
Jiki na kiwanda chake wanachokupa. Lakini

00:02:41.760 --> 00:02:45.380
lengo la tatu si dhahiri sana, lakini pengine

00:02:45.500 --> 00:02:48.220
ndilo muhimu zaidi, nalo ni kujifunza

00:02:48.280 --> 00:02:51.800
kufikiri kama msanidi programu. Kwa muda

00:02:51.860 --> 00:02:54.590
mrefu, hili litaamua kama utakuwa

00:02:54.620 --> 00:02:57.260
msanidi programu wa kawaida au bingwa. Kwa hiyo

00:02:57.300 --> 00:02:59.320
kama hujali kuwa msanidi

00:02:59.380 --> 00:03:02.450
programu bingwa, unaweza kupuuza hili. Lakini

00:03:02.480 --> 00:03:03.690
kwa wengi, hilo ndilo litakuwa

00:03:03.700 --> 00:03:05.480
lengo, na hiki ndicho kipande ninachotaka

00:03:05.520 --> 00:03:09.760
ukizingatie zaidi. Unapotatua

00:03:09.800 --> 00:03:12.460
mazoezi machache yajayo, nataka sana

00:03:12.500 --> 00:03:14.440
ujitahidi kutokisia

00:03:14.460 --> 00:03:16.960
majibu au kujaribu huku na kule kutafuta

00:03:16.980 --> 00:03:19.420
suluhisho. Nataka uyashughulikie

00:03:19.430 --> 00:03:22.320
matatizo haya kwa kutumia mantiki. Kila kitu unachohitaji

00:03:22.400 --> 00:03:25.400
kujua ili kupata suluhisho

00:03:25.440 --> 00:03:27.920
kimo kwenye maagizo. Nimejitahidi sana

00:03:28.100 --> 00:03:31.220
kukupa maagizo yaliyo wazi yanayokupa

00:03:31.260 --> 00:03:34.640
taarifa unazohitaji. Kwa hiyo chukua muda wako

00:03:34.900 --> 00:03:38.380
kusoma maagizo, na chukua muda wako kufikiri

00:03:38.440 --> 00:03:41.960
kabla ya kuanza kuandika msimbo. Ukijikuta

00:03:42.020 --> 00:03:44.120
unakisia tu, punguza mwendo

00:03:44.200 --> 00:03:47.300
kidogo, soma maagizo, labda toa kalamu

00:03:47.320 --> 00:03:49.480
na karatasi uchore mambo,

00:03:49.640 --> 00:03:51.900
kisha ujaribu tena kuandika msimbo.

00:03:53.580 --> 00:03:55.780
Sawa, nenda ukatatue mazoezi, na tutaonana

00:03:55.820 --> 00:03:56.520
hapa tena hivi karibuni.
